{"page":570,"width":1735,"height":2644,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"4 할당방법 633","words":[{"text":"4","x":1248,"y":162,"width":21,"height":22},{"text":"할당방법","x":1287,"y":160,"width":97,"height":28},{"text":"633","x":1456,"y":157,"width":59,"height":30}]},{"text":"다. 파일의 시작 주소를 메모리에 쉽게 유지할 수 있으므로 i 번째 블록(또는 다음 블록)","words":[{"text":"다.","x":283,"y":290,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"파일의","x":337,"y":290,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"시작","x":450,"y":292,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"주소를","x":526,"y":293,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"메모리에","x":631,"y":292,"width":115,"height":37},{"text":"쉽게","x":762,"y":294,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"유지할","x":832,"y":294,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":934,"y":294,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"있으므로","x":980,"y":293,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"i","x":1114,"y":296,"width":8,"height":29},{"text":"번째","x":1136,"y":292,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"블록(또는","x":1209,"y":293,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"다음","x":1364,"y":292,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"블록)","x":1440,"y":293,"width":76,"height":41}]},{"text":"의 주소를 즉시 기1산하여 직접 읽을 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"의","x":284,"y":351,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"주소를","x":327,"y":352,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"즉시","x":437,"y":353,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"기1산하여","x":515,"y":353,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"직접","x":649,"y":353,"width":53,"height":36},{"text":"읽을","x":719,"y":354,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":786,"y":355,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":828,"y":355,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"연결 할당의 경우 다음 블록의 주소를 메모리에 유지하고 직접 읽을 수 있다. 이 방","words":[{"text":"연결","x":347,"y":413,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"할당의","x":424,"y":414,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"경우","x":536,"y":415,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"다음","x":609,"y":414,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"블록의","x":680,"y":414,"width":85,"height":37},{"text":"주소를","x":781,"y":416,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"메모리에","x":884,"y":414,"width":117,"height":39},{"text":"유지하고","x":1017,"y":416,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"직접","x":1156,"y":416,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"읽을","x":1233,"y":416,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1307,"y":416,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1355,"y":416,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1441,"y":416,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"방","x":1486,"y":418,"width":33,"height":35}]},{"text":"법은 순차적 액세스에 적합하다. 그러나 직접 액세스의 경우 i 번째 블록에 액세스 하려","words":[{"text":"법은","x":286,"y":473,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"순차적","x":363,"y":474,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"액세스에","x":476,"y":475,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"적합하다.","x":615,"y":475,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"그러나","x":754,"y":477,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"직접","x":856,"y":476,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"액세스의","x":928,"y":477,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"경우","x":1064,"y":478,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"i","x":1137,"y":480,"width":9,"height":30},{"text":"번째","x":1160,"y":477,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"블록에","x":1234,"y":477,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"액세스","x":1345,"y":477,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"하려","x":1454,"y":477,"width":61,"height":37}]},{"text":"면 i 번의 블록 읽기가 필요할 수 있다. 이 문제는 직접 액세스가 필요한 프로그램","words":[{"text":"면","x":285,"y":534,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"i","x":331,"y":537,"width":9,"height":29},{"text":"번의","x":357,"y":534,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"블록","x":435,"y":536,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"읽기가","x":515,"y":536,"width":91,"height":38},{"text":"필요할","x":621,"y":536,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":721,"y":537,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":766,"y":537,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":845,"y":537,"width":24,"height":36},{"text":"문제는","x":886,"y":538,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"직접","x":992,"y":539,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"액세스가","x":1065,"y":538,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"필요한","x":1204,"y":538,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램","x":1389,"y":538,"width":127,"height":36}]},{"text":"이 연결 할당을 사용해서는 안 되는 이유를 나타낸다.","words":[{"text":"이","x":285,"y":595,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"연결","x":331,"y":595,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"할당을","x":406,"y":596,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"사용해서는","x":515,"y":597,"width":155,"height":38},{"text":"안","x":681,"y":598,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"되는","x":722,"y":598,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"이유를","x":792,"y":598,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"나타낸다.","x":891,"y":598,"width":126,"height":38}]},{"text":"따라서 몇몇 시스템들은 연속(contiguous) 할당을 사용하여 직접 접근 파일을, 연","words":[{"text":"따라서","x":347,"y":657,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"몇몇","x":461,"y":657,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"시스템들은","x":538,"y":658,"width":153,"height":37},{"text":"연속(contiguous)","x":706,"y":659,"width":247,"height":43},{"text":"할당을","x":969,"y":661,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"사용하여","x":1073,"y":661,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"직접","x":1213,"y":661,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"접근","x":1291,"y":661,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"파일을,","x":1367,"y":661,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"연","x":1489,"y":661,"width":29,"height":36}]},{"text":"결(linked) 할당을 A卜\u0026하여 순자 접근 파일을 모두 지원한다. 이들 시스템에서는 파일","words":[{"text":"결(linked)","x":286,"y":717,"width":161,"height":40},{"text":"할당을","x":464,"y":719,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"A卜\u0026하여","x":572,"y":720,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"순자","x":707,"y":721,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"접근","x":781,"y":721,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":851,"y":720,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"모두","x":954,"y":724,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"지원한다.","x":1029,"y":723,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"이들","x":1174,"y":723,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"시스템에서는","x":1249,"y":722,"width":191,"height":37},{"text":"파일","x":1454,"y":722,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"이 생성될 때 접근 형태가 먼저 선언되어야 한다. 순자 접근을 위해서 생성된 파일은 연","words":[{"text":"이","x":286,"y":779,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"생성될","x":331,"y":779,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":445,"y":779,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"접근","x":490,"y":780,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"형태가","x":566,"y":781,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"먼저","x":672,"y":781,"width":54,"height":37},{"text":"선언되어야","x":744,"y":781,"width":148,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":904,"y":782,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"순자","x":984,"y":784,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"접근을","x":1058,"y":784,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"위해서","x":1163,"y":784,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"생성된","x":1269,"y":783,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"파일은","x":1377,"y":783,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"연","x":1489,"y":784,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"결 할당되며, 직접 접근을 위해서는 사용될 수 없다. 직접 접근을 위해서 생성된 파일은","words":[{"text":"결","x":286,"y":840,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"할당되며,","x":331,"y":840,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"직접","x":486,"y":840,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"접근을","x":564,"y":841,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"위해서는","x":669,"y":842,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"사용될","x":801,"y":842,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":902,"y":843,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"없다.","x":947,"y":843,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"직접","x":1028,"y":845,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"접근을","x":1101,"y":844,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"위해서","x":1206,"y":844,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"생성된","x":1313,"y":843,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"파일은","x":1422,"y":844,"width":97,"height":36}]},{"text":"연속 할당되며, 직접 접근과 순차 접근 모두 사용할 수 있다. 그러나 파일을 생성할 때","words":[{"text":"연속","x":286,"y":901,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"할당되며,","x":365,"y":901,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"직접","x":521,"y":902,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"접근과","x":600,"y":902,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"순차","x":704,"y":903,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"접근","x":780,"y":903,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"모두","x":852,"y":905,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"사용할","x":926,"y":904,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1029,"y":906,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1075,"y":905,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"그러나","x":1157,"y":905,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"파일을","x":1265,"y":904,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"생성할","x":1376,"y":904,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":1488,"y":906,"width":27,"height":35}]},{"text":"최대 크기를 먼저 선언하여야 한다. 이 경우 운영체제는 두 가지 방법들을 모두 제공하","words":[{"text":"최대","x":285,"y":962,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"크기를","x":365,"y":962,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"먼저","x":480,"y":963,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"선언하여야","x":556,"y":963,"width":155,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":723,"y":964,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":807,"y":964,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"경우","x":850,"y":965,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제는","x":922,"y":965,"width":150,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1086,"y":967,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":1129,"y":966,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"방법들을","x":1204,"y":965,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"모두","x":1344,"y":966,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"제공하","x":1424,"y":965,"width":96,"height":37}]},{"text":"는 알고리즘과 자료구조를 유지해야 한다. 또 이렇게 선언했던 파일을 다른 형태로 바꾸","words":[{"text":"는","x":284,"y":1025,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"알고리즘과","x":331,"y":1023,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"자료구조를","x":506,"y":1024,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"유지해야","x":675,"y":1025,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":808,"y":1026,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"또","x":889,"y":1029,"width":30,"height":27},{"text":"이렇게","x":932,"y":1026,"width":85,"height":37},{"text":"선언했던","x":1033,"y":1026,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"파일을","x":1165,"y":1026,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1271,"y":1026,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"형태로","x":1347,"y":1025,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"바꾸","x":1456,"y":1025,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"려면 기존 파일의 내용을 새로 복사하면서 변경해야 한다. 복사 후 기존 파일은 삭제될","words":[{"text":"려면","x":287,"y":1084,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"기존","x":366,"y":1085,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"파일의","x":445,"y":1085,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"내용을","x":556,"y":1085,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"새로","x":662,"y":1086,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"복사하면서","x":736,"y":1086,"width":148,"height":37},{"text":"변경해야","x":903,"y":1087,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":1035,"y":1087,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"복사","x":1117,"y":1087,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"후","x":1192,"y":1088,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"기존","x":1238,"y":1086,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"파일은","x":1312,"y":1085,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"삭제될","x":1423,"y":1085,"width":96,"height":35}]},{"text":"수 있다.","words":[{"text":"수","x":284,"y":1146,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":332,"y":1146,"width":70,"height":37}]},{"text":"색인 할당의 경우는 더 복잡하다. 색인 블록이 메모리 내에 상주한다면 직접 접근이","words":[{"text":"색인","x":347,"y":1207,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"할당의","x":424,"y":1207,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"경우는","x":536,"y":1208,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":643,"y":1207,"width":25,"height":37},{"text":"복잡하다.","x":684,"y":1208,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"색인","x":827,"y":1208,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"블록이","x":900,"y":1209,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":1003,"y":1209,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"내에","x":1106,"y":1209,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"상주한다면","x":1177,"y":1207,"width":156,"height":38},{"text":"직접","x":1349,"y":1206,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"접근이","x":1426,"y":1206,"width":92,"height":36}]},{"text":"기능하다. 그러나 메모리 내에 색인 블록을 전부 상주시카는 것은 많은 양의 메모리를","words":[{"text":"기능하다.","x":285,"y":1268,"width":138,"height":36},{"text":"그러나","x":442,"y":1267,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"메모리","x":554,"y":1268,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"내에","x":663,"y":1268,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"색인","x":738,"y":1269,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"블록을","x":813,"y":1270,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"전부","x":920,"y":1270,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"상주시카는","x":993,"y":1270,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"것은","x":1161,"y":1270,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":1236,"y":1270,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"양의","x":1314,"y":1268,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"메모리를","x":1393,"y":1267,"width":130,"height":37}]},{"text":"필요로 한다. 만약 이 메모리 공간을 사용할 수 없다면 먼저 색인 블록을 읽은 후 원하는","words":[{"text":"필요로","x":286,"y":1328,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":396,"y":1329,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"만약","x":483,"y":1329,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":560,"y":1329,"width":26,"height":37},{"text":"메모리","x":603,"y":1329,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"공간을","x":706,"y":1330,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"사용할","x":809,"y":1330,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":912,"y":1331,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"없다면","x":955,"y":1331,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"먼저","x":1057,"y":1331,"width":56,"height":37},{"text":"색인","x":1129,"y":1331,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"블록을","x":1200,"y":1331,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"읽은","x":1308,"y":1330,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"후","x":1380,"y":1329,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"원하는","x":1426,"y":1328,"width":96,"height":37}]},{"text":"자료 블록을 읽어야 한다. 대단히 큰 파일의 경우 거의 마지막에 있는 블록을 읽으려면","words":[{"text":"자료","x":286,"y":1390,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"블록을","x":366,"y":1390,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"읽어야","x":481,"y":1390,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":587,"y":1390,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"대단히","x":673,"y":1391,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"큰","x":777,"y":1394,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"파일의","x":822,"y":1392,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"경우","x":928,"y":1393,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"거의","x":1001,"y":1392,"width":56,"height":37},{"text":"마지막에","x":1073,"y":1392,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1211,"y":1392,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"블록을","x":1283,"y":1391,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"읽으려면","x":1395,"y":1390,"width":125,"height":36}]},{"text":"모든 인덱스 블록을 읽어 들여 포인터를 따라가야만 한다. 따라서 색인 할당 방식의 성","words":[{"text":"모든","x":286,"y":1453,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"인덱스","x":368,"y":1452,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"블록을","x":478,"y"