"블록)은","x":1370,"y":1574,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"연","x":1491,"y":1575,"width":29,"height":35}]},{"text":"속 할당하고 파일이 더 커지면 지동으로 색인 할당으로 전환한다. 대부븐의 파일이 작고","words":[{"text":"속","x":288,"y":1635,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"할당하고","x":333,"y":1634,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"파일이","x":475,"y":1634,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"더","x":585,"y":1635,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"커지면","x":629,"y":1634,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"지동으로","x":732,"y":1635,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"색인","x":866,"y":1636,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"할당으로","x":938,"y":1636,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"전환한다.","x":1072,"y":1636,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"대부븐의","x":1215,"y":1636,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"파일이","x":1351,"y":1635,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"작고","x":1457,"y":1635,"width":65,"height":37}]},{"text":"연속 할당이 작은 파일의 경우 효율적이기 때문에 평균 성능이 상당히 좋아진다.","words":[{"text":"연속","x":291,"y":1695,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"할당이","x":365,"y":1695,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"작은","x":474,"y":1695,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"파일의","x":549,"y":1695,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"경우","x":657,"y":1696,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"효율적이기","x":728,"y":1696,"width":148,"height":38},{"text":"때문에","x":893,"y":1697,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"평균","x":993,"y":1697,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"성능이","x":1064,"y":1697,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"상당히","x":1165,"y":1697,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"좋아진다.","x":1270,"y":1696,"width":132,"height":38}]},{"text":"이외에도 많은 최적화 방법들이 있으며 현재 중에 있다. CPU와 디스크 속도간","words":[{"text":"이외에도","x":352,"y":1755,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":492,"y":1756,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"최적화","x":568,"y":1756,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"방법들이","x":672,"y":1756,"width":119,"height":38},{"text":"있으며","x":808,"y":1758,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"현재","x":908,"y":1758,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"중에","x":1048,"y":1758,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1123,"y":1758